01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
Pirates of the Caribbean: Dead Men Tell No Tales (released in some territories as Pirates of the Caribbean: Salazar's Revenge) is a 2017
American swashbuckler fantasy film that is the fifth in the Pirates of the Caribbean film series, following On Stranger Tides (2011).

14
01:09:27,692 --> 01:09:33,692
The film was directed by Joachim Rønning and Espen
Sandberg and written by Jeff Nathanson.

15
01:14:25,384 --> 01:14:31,384
It features an ensemble cast including Johnny Depp, Javier Bardem, Geoffrey
Rush, Brenton Thwaites, Kaya Scodelario, and Kevin McNally.

16
01:19:23,076 --> 01:19:29,076
The film follows a search for the Trident of Poseidon by a down-on-his-luck Captain Jack Sparrow pursued by Captain Armando Salazar and a crew
of deadly ghosts who have escaped from the Devil's Triangle, determined to kill every pirate at sea and take revenge on Sparrow.

17
01:24:20,769 --> 01:24:26,769
Development of the film started shortly before the previous film was released in May 2011, with
Rossio writing the initial script, and Depp being involved in the writing process.

18
01:29:18,461 --> 01:29:24,461
In early 2013, Nathanson was hired to write a new script, while Rønning and
Sandberg became involved in the project shortly afterward.

19
01:34:16,153 --> 01:34:22,153
The filmmakers cited the series' first installment, The Curse of the Black
Pearl (2003), as inspiration for the script and tone of the film.

20
01:39:13,846 --> 01:39:19,846
Initially planned for a 2015 release, the film was delayed to 2016
and then to 2017, due to script and budget issues.

21
01:44:11,538 --> 01:44:17,538
Principal photography started in Queensland, Australia in February 2015, after the Australian
government offered Disney $20 million in tax incentives, and ended that July.

22
01:49:09,230 --> 01:49:15,230
With an estimated production budget  of $230–320 million, it
is among the most expensive films ever made.

23
01:54:06,923 --> 01:54:12,923
Dead Men Tell No Tales premiered at the Shanghai Disney Resort on May 11,
2017, and was released in the United States on May 26.

24
01:59:04,615 --> 01:59:10,615
The film received generally negative reviews from
critics and grossed $796 million.

25
02:04:02,307 --> 02:04:08,307
The film explores themes of treasure map, artifact, pirate, swashbuckler, ghost.
